// Bio Ships Pack: six living ships of a bio-organic alien faction: carapaces,
// membranes, eyes, tendrils and glowing spore sacs.
//
// Drawn like the Alien Ship Pack: 24x28 canvas, the game's VGA palette only
// (olive-green ramp 2, bone ramp 10, flesh ramp 4, neon-green glow ramp 12),
// one-pixel dark outline, light from the upper left. Each ship provides its
// five poses (ship_poses): neutral, half and full bank to each side, drawn as
// a roll (the hull slides toward the turn, the lowered wing shortens and
// darkens). Sprites made by utils/bio_ships_art.py from PixelLab drafts.
//
// Six ships: mods share 14 ship slots and the Alien Ship Pack takes 8, so both
// packs fill every slot together. The ship image table holds five poses for
// each of the 14 slots (ADR 0134): see the README, "Limits".
// Price and armor matched to the original ships of the same price (see the
// README table). All six are sold everywhere (always_available).
{
  "$schema": "../mod.schema.json",
  "format_version": 1,
  "name": "Bio Ships Pack",
  "author": "OpenTyrian2000 Team",
  "version": "1.0",
  "description": "6 green bio-organic alien ships drawn in the original Tyrian style.",
  "enabled": false,

